Source revision: efedf47f4d4ae52d17ad2e108a5b8795d41537a3

The original application code is distributed under Apache License 2.0,
retained in LICENSE. This port modifies the arena integration, geometry
loader and title/loading interface to display Modelica physics compiled
by Rumoca. It is a CogniPilot application.

Robot geometry is derived from Pollen's Microduck robot assets. The
existing robot mesh attribution and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms remain at
../third_party/microduck_rl/LICENSE-MODELS.md. The GLB is an alternate
visual representation, not a replacement physics or collision model.

Three.js add-on sources are from r160 and retain the Three.js MIT license
at ../vendor/THREE-LICENSE. Anton is distributed under its retained
SIL Open Font License (Anton-OFL.txt). CogniPilot and Rumoca logos come
from their respective project repositories; provenance is in SOURCE.json.
